Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 19:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 02/13] Add mimalloc backend glue (--with-malloc=mimalloc)

Shim and amalgamation TU only.  Upstream sources come from the
mimalloc 3.5.0 tarball unpacked into malloc/mimalloc/ in %prep.
---
 malloc/malloc-mimalloc-impl.c |  23 ++
 malloc/malloc-mimalloc.c      | 444 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 467 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 malloc/malloc-mimalloc-impl.c
 create mode 100644 malloc/malloc-mimalloc.c

